+<aside class="decision-box article-common-rule" aria-label="Play Points common rules"><strong>Play Points common rules</strong><ul><li>In the United States, Bronze earns 1 point per US$1 on eligible Google Play purchases. Higher levels raise the base rate; tax is excluded and the highest eligible promotional earn rate applies.</li><li>Google Play Points are earned only when the purchase is processed as an eligible Google Play transaction. A publisher Web Store, PC client, console store or other external checkout may have its own discount or rewards, but that does not automatically make it eligible for Google Play Points.</li></ul></aside>
+<section class="section" id="decision-guide"><h2 id="article-section-3">Which route makes sense?</h2><ul><li>Treat Monthly Card value as gradual resources, not instant 300-roll funding.</li><li>Play Points come from paid Google Play transactions, not spending Orundum.</li></ul></section>
+<section class="section" id="before-paying"><h2 id="article-section-4">Before you pay</h2><p>Check the exact banner series, dates and 200/300-contract target.</p><p>Recheck the live price, supported country, account and checkout provider immediately before payment.</p></section>
+<div class="cta-box"><h3 id="article-section-5">Check the purchase in the game calculator</h3><p>Use the amount and final earn rate shown on the Google Play account that will actually pay.</p><a class="cta-btn" href="/en/games/arknights/">Open game calculator</a></div>
+<aside class="official-source-note"><h2 id="article-section-6">Official sources checked</h2><ul><li><a href="https://support.google.com/googleplay/answer/9077192?co=GENIE.CountryCode%3DUS&amp;hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Play Points earning rules — United States</a></li><li><a href="https://support.google.com/googleplay/answer/9080348?co=GENIE.CountryCode%3DUS&amp;hl=en" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Play Points levels — United States</a></li><li><a href="https://www.arknights.global/news/2926" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Arknights Global 2026 Limited Headhunting notice</a></li></ul></aside>
