 <article class="content">
 <div class="intro">The global official site launched a Web Store in July 2025 and says it can provide better Crystal deals than the app, while warning that the store is unavailable in some countries and regions.</div>
 <div class="decision-box"><strong>Which route makes sense?</strong><p>If available, compare the Web Store Crystal amount with Play Points from Google Play.</p></div>
