 <section class="section" id="official-source-scope"><h2 id="article-section-2">What the official sources say</h2><p>The global official site launched a Web Store in July 2025 and says it can provide better Crystal deals than the app, while warning that the store is unavailable in some countries and regions.</p><p>Official terminology used on this page:</p><ul><li><strong>HATSUNE MIKU: COLORFUL STAGE!</strong></li><li><strong>Crystals</strong></li><li><strong>Web Store</strong></li><li><strong>Premium Mission Pass</strong></li></ul></section>
-<section class="section" id="google-play-rule"><h2 id="article-section-3">Google Play Points: what counts</h2><p>In the United States, Bronze earns 1 point per US$1 on eligible Google Play purchases. Higher levels raise the base rate; tax is excluded and the highest eligible promotional earn rate applies.</p><p>Google Play Points are earned only when the purchase is processed as an eligible Google Play transaction. A publisher Web Store, PC client, console store or other external checkout may have its own discount or rewards, but that does not automatically make it eligible for Google Play Points.</p></section>
-<section class="section" id="decision-guide"><h2 id="article-section-4">Which route makes sense?</h2><ul><li>If available, compare the Web Store Crystal amount with Play Points from Google Play.</li><li>The official Web Store is an external checkout, so do not stack Play Points automatically.</li><li>Compare the exact current SKU because passes and limited packs change.</li></ul></section>
-<section class="section" id="before-paying"><h2 id="article-section-5">Before you pay</h2><p>Verify country availability and the Player ID before purchase.</p><p>Recheck the live price, supported country, account and checkout provider immediately before payment.</p></section>
-<div class="cta-box"><h3 id="article-section-6">Check the purchase in the game calculator</h3><p>Use the amount and final earn rate shown on the Google Play account that will actually pay.</p><a class="cta-btn" href="/en/games/proseka/">Open game calculator</a></div>
