 <article class="content">
 <div class="intro">Welkin is a time-based product: much of its value arrives through daily Primogem claims, so it should not be compared with an immediate Genesis Crystal top-up only by sticker price.</div>
 <div class="decision-box"><strong>Which route makes sense?</strong><p>Value only the daily Primogems you expect to claim.</p></div>
-<nav class="intl-article-toc" aria-label="Table of contents"><h2 id="article-section-1">Contents</h2><ol><li><a href="#official-source-scope">What the official sources say</a></li><li><a href="#google-play-rule">Google Play Points: what counts</a></li><li><a href="#decision-guide">Which route makes sense?</a></li><li><a href="#before-paying">Before you pay</a></li></ol></nav>
+<nav class="intl-article-toc" aria-label="Contents"><h2 id="article-section-1">Contents</h2><ol><li><a href="#official-source-scope">What the official sources say</a></li><li><a href="#decision-guide">Which route makes sense?</a></li><li><a href="#before-paying">Before you pay</a></li></ol></nav>
 <section class="section" id="official-source-scope"><h2 id="article-section-2">What the official sources say</h2><p>Welkin is a time-based product: much of its value arrives through daily Primogem claims, so it should not be compared with an immediate Genesis Crystal top-up only by sticker price.</p><p>Official terminology used on this page:</p><ul><li><strong>Blessing of the Welkin Moon</strong></li><li><strong>Genesis Crystals</strong></li><li><strong>Primogems</strong></li></ul></section>
-<section class="section" id="google-play-rule"><h2 id="article-section-3">Google Play Points: what counts</h2><p>In the United States, Bronze earns 1 point per US$1 on eligible Google Play purchases. Higher levels raise the base rate; tax is excluded and the highest eligible promotional earn rate applies.</p><p>Google Play Points are earned only when the purchase is processed as an eligible Google Play transaction. A publisher Web Store, PC client, console store or other external checkout may have its own discount or rewards, but that does not automatically make it eligible for Google Play Points.</p></section>
-<section class="section" id="decision-guide"><h2 id="article-section-4">Which route makes sense?</h2><ul><li>Value only the daily Primogems you expect to claim.</li><li>Compare direct Genesis Crystal top-ups separately when you need currency now.</li><li>An official HoYoverse web checkout is not automatically a Google Play transaction.</li></ul></section>
-<section class="section" id="before-paying"><h2 id="article-section-5">Before you pay</h2><p>Use the live US price shown in the game or official checkout; prices and payment routes can change.</p><p>Recheck the live price, supported country, account and checkout provider immediately before payment.</p></section>
-<div class="cta-box"><h3 id="article-section-6">Check the purchase in the game calculator</h3><p>Use the amount and final earn rate shown on the Google Play account that will actually pay.</p><a class="cta-btn" href="/en/games/genshin/">Open game calculator</a></div>
