         <section class="answer-box" aria-labelledby="weekly-answer"><h2 id="weekly-answer">Start with the name of the benefit</h2><p>The regular Play Points weekly prize is for Silver level or above and resets Friday. Play Pass weekly bonuses and boosters are separate Thursday benefits for eligible subscribers and family members. <span class="marker-yellow">Thursday and Friday refer to different benefits</span>, so seeing one does not confirm that the other is missing.</p><p>For Super Weekly, use the eligibility and claim conditions on the card shown in your own Perks tab.</p></section>
