 <article class="content">
 <div class="intro">Heaven Burns Red operates localized Web Shops in some Asian markets. The Taiwan shop currently lists NT$ Quartz packs and shop points and explicitly limits purchases to Taiwan, Hong Kong and Macao. That does not create a matching US shop.</div>
