 <section class="section" id="official-source-scope"><h2 id="article-section-2">What the official sources say</h2><p>HoYoverse operates an official Top-Up Center for Honkai Impact 3rd, with payment methods and currencies varying by country/region. It is an official but separate checkout from Google Play.</p><p>Official terminology used on this page:</p><ul><li><strong>Honkai Impact 3rd</strong></li><li><strong>Top-Up Center</strong></li><li><strong>Crystals</strong></li><li><strong>Monthly Card</strong></li></ul></section>
-<section class="section" id="google-play-rule"><h2 id="article-section-3">Google Play Points: what counts</h2><p>In the United States, Bronze earns 1 point per US$1 on eligible Google Play purchases. Higher levels raise the base rate; tax is excluded and the highest eligible promotional earn rate applies.</p><p>Google Play Points are earned only when the purchase is processed as an eligible Google Play transaction. A publisher Web Store, PC client, console store or other external checkout may have its own discount or rewards, but that does not automatically make it eligible for Google Play Points.</p></section>
-<section class="section" id="decision-guide"><h2 id="article-section-4">Which route makes sense?</h2><ul><li>Compare Top-Up Center bonuses with Play Points as separate benefit columns.</li><li>Do not add US Play Points to an external HoYoverse checkout.</li><li>Check Monthly Card validity before adding more time.</li></ul></section>
-<section class="section" id="before-paying"><h2 id="article-section-5">Before you pay</h2><p>Confirm server, HoYoverse account, country and currency.</p><p>Recheck the live price, supported country, account and checkout provider immediately before payment.</p></section>
-<div class="cta-box"><h3 id="article-section-6">Check the purchase in the game calculator</h3><p>Use the amount and final earn rate shown on the Google Play account that will actually pay.</p><a class="cta-btn" href="/en/games/honkai3rd/">Open game calculator</a></div>
