+<aside class="official-source-note"><h2 id="article-section-6">확인한 공식 출처</h2><ul><li><a href="https://support.google.com/googleplay/answer/9077192?co=GENIE.CountryCode%3DKR&amp;hl=ko" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Play Points 적립 규칙 — 대한민국</a></li><li><a href="https://support.google.com/googleplay/answer/9080348?co=GENIE.CountryCode%3DKR&amp;hl=ko" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google Play Points 등급 기준 — 대한민국</a></li><li><a href="https://genshin.hoyoverse.com/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Genshin Impact official site</a></li></ul></aside>
+<section class="section"><h2 id="article-section-7">자주 묻는 질문</h2><h3 id="article-section-8">공월 축복 웹 결제도 Play Points가 적립되나요?</h3><p>Google Play에서 처리되는 대상 결제인지 확인해야 합니다.</p></section>
